abstract: "NOAA Coral Reef Watch's real, official Degree Heating Week (DHW) coral-bleaching threshold system (0-20C-weeks, 5 alert levels), the real escalating series of four documented global bleaching events (Hughes et al. 2017/2018, NOAA 2024: 21% -> 37% -> 68% -> 83.7% of reef area affected), a real thermal-acidification synergy (Guillermic et al. 2021: heat disables corals' acidification-coping mechanism), and Walker et al. 2023 (the honesty check: bleaching resistance varies by genotype with real fitness tradeoffs). Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge and no invented Gamma value -- see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P114."
